    "created_at": "2019-04-26T15:35:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-04-26T15:58:32Z",
    "body": "FWIW I almost added some support for this in Firefox a few months ago but hesitated since it wasn't in the spec yet. We will likely only use it for the following in the foreseeable future:\r\na) [Don't save the value in form history](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1547294)\r\nb) [Don't autofill passwords into it](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1547292) (we will still allow the user to fill a saved password with user interaction to mitigate potential abuse that I mentioned earlier)",
    "author_association": "NONE",
