    "updated_at": "2019-04-26T18:06:18Z",
    "body": "Sounds like we should add this to the spec! Although I think it's a little weird that it sounds like Firefox's plan for implementing is to just treat it as autocomplete=off?\r\n\r\nBut as I briefly noted up thread, autofill is a weird area, so as long as we have multiple browsers who want to consider this field special in some way, we should land something in the spec that the ecosystem can coordinate around.",
